PRIMARY RESULT

A calibrated high-confidence action core:

substantially reduces:
false promotion

and:
cross-boundary leakage

relative to:
hard observed labels.

It also improves:
the severe net tail.

But:

it sacrifices:
current coverage
and
mean reward

by quarantining uncertain members.

Thus:

TOPOLOGY FIREWALL
IS NOT FREE.

