NOISE INTERPRETATION

As topology degrades:

quarantine becomes:
more protective

and:
more expensive in foregone action.

At 25% label noise:

cross-boundary leakage is reduced by:
approximately 91%.

But:
coverage falls by roughly:
45% relative to hard partition.

This is a real:
BOUNDARY-SAFETY / ACTION-COVERAGE
tradeoff.

